=2 Walkthrough
* Once you accept the assignment, you will -not- be provided with any supplies. You will receive {k:Mor. FS resource container} at the {p:Frontier Station}.
** **As of Feb 18, 2014 update, {p:Waypoints|Waypoint} can be used to complete this task. {k:Mor. FS resource container} will not break.**

+ Zone out to {z:Yahse Hunting Grounds} from {z:Eastern Adoulin} at (G-5).
+ Run northwest and zone to {z:Moh Gates} at (H-5) in {z:Yahse Hunting Grounds}.
+ Run north and zone to {z:Morimar Basalt Fields} at (G-5).
+ From the entrance of {z:Morimar Basalt Fields}, run a little ways into the first open area and the {p:Frontier Station} will be at the northern end.
+ Speak to the {n:Station Administrator} at (K-10) to receive {k:Mor. FS resource container}.

* Return to the {n:Task Delegator} to deliver the supplies and receive your reward.

=2 Notes
* Movement speed increasing effects recommended.

